---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/skills.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- each point: the points, then Skills
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 1
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 raised skill 1 to level 1
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 28=2
   -> send conn#4 Skills 1=1 grade 0
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 1
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 raised skill 1 to level 2
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 28=1
   -> send conn#4 Skills 1=2 grade 0
-- refused: group 2's skill, a skill the content does not have, level 6's skill
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 16
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You cannot learn this skill."
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 6
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You cannot learn this skill."
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 5
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You need level 6 for this skill."
-- the last point, then none left
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 3
   -> event: conn#4: character 1 raised skill 3 to level 1
   -> send conn#4 PointsChanged 28=0
   -> send conn#4 Skills 1=2 grade 0, 3=1 grade 0
@1000 conn#4 sends RaiseSkill 3
   -> send conn#4 Chat kind=1 vid=0 "You have no skill points left."
-- the skills are saved with the character
@1000 conn#4 closed: the client left
   -> store #8: save #1 at (475000, 966100) played 0s group=1 skills=[1=2 3=1]
   -> event: conn#4: closed: the client left
@1000 store answers #8: saved: Ok(())
